AI Evaluation Workbench — Working Title

This repository contains an experimental AI evaluation workbench for bounded evaluation, evidence review, configurable rubrics, hard/non-compensatory gates, provenance checks, comparison controls, replay/debugging, escalation, and explicit tested-versus-NOT-TESTED coverage.

Current behavior is keyed to repository-local functional roles and capabilities. Historical Agent Apogee, Agent Amethyst, Agent Sentinel, and related named-agent labels may remain in compatibility or provenance records, but they confer no DGAF authority and do not independently define current permissions, certification, or governance status.

References to DGAF, the NIST AI Risk Management Framework (AI RMF), OWASP Agentic Top 10, and other governance/security frameworks are evaluation or alignment references only. Their presence does not establish compliance, certification, or production readiness, and local tests do not constitute external assurance.

Repository slug `junior-apogee-app` is retained for compatibility and provenance while the product uses the working title AI Evaluation Workbench. Evaluation results from this repository do not by themselves authorize deployment, production use, or DGAF governance actions.

Current DGAF reference: https://github.com/ndrorchestration/DGAF-Framework
